    "description": "Start Robinson Crusoe and follow a restless man who leaves home for the sea. He survives pirates, storms, and a shipwreck, then must build a life alone on an island. Later he finds Friday and fights for a way back to the world.\n\nThis A2 English version uses short sentences, clear scenes, and chapter summaries. It gives you a full classic in simple English, with 33 chapters and about 32,000 words.",
    "author": "Daniel Defoe",
