    "description": "Start Around the World in 80 Days and follow Phileas Fogg's race against the clock. Fogg and Passepartout cross oceans, railways, India, Japan, and America while a detective follows them and every delay matters.\n\nThis A2 English version uses short sentences, clear scenes, and chapter summaries. It gives you Jules Verne's adventure in simple English, with 33 chapters and about 26,000 words.",
