    "description": "Start The Hound of the Baskervilles with a family curse and a warning on the moor. Holmes and Watson follow strange clues, protect Sir Henry, and uncover the truth behind a deadly hound.\n\nThis A2 English version uses short sentences, clear scenes, and chapter summaries. It gives you Arthur Conan Doyle's mystery in simple English, with 25 chapters and about 18,000 words.",
